---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';

import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout>
  <Navbar />

  <main>
    
    <section class="hero-section">
        <h1 >Google my Business Profile</h1>
        <h2 >Creatività, MarGoogle my Business Profileketing e Strategia</h2>

        <span class="caption-text">Se non sei su Google Maps, per molti clienti non esisti</span>
    
        <p class="description-text">
    Quando qualcuno cerca su Google un ristorante, un idraulico, un commercialista o una web agency nella propria città, i primi risultati che vede non sono siti web: sono le schede Google Business Profile, accompagnate dalla mappa e da tutte le informazioni essenziali sull’attività. Valutazioni, orari, indirizzo, numero di telefono, foto.   </p>
  "Negozi vicino a me" è una delle ricerche più fatte ogni giorno. Un profilo Google Business curato ti fa comparire nella mappa, nelle recensioni e nei risultati locali — spesso prima ancora del tuo sito web. Lo creiamo o lo sistemiamo per te, da zero.  
  </section>


 <div class="container">
  <div class="gb-header text-center">
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <span class="rank-title animate-fade-up delay-1">Google Maps</span>
      </h2>
    
    </div>

  <p class="section-subtitle-center">
       Posiziono la tua attività in cima alle ricerche locali per farti scegliere prima di chiunque altro. </p>
    
    <!-- Google Maps mock visual -->
    <div class="gb-visual rank-layout">
      <div class="gb-map-mock">
        <div class="map-bg">
          <svg class="map-svg" viewBox="0 0 400 300" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect width="400" height="300" fill="#1a2332" />
            <g transform="rotate(-25 200 150)">
              <!-- Strade verticali (diventano diagonali dopo la rotazione) -->
              <line x1="-90" y1="-100" x2="-90" y2="450" class="mroad" />
              <line x1="-20" y1="-100" x2="-20" y2="450" class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="50"  y1="-100" x2="50"  y2="450" class="mroad mroad-major" />
              <line x1="120" y1="-100" x2="120" y2="450" class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="190" y1="-100" x2="190" y2="450" class="mroad" />
              <line x1="260" y1="-100" x2="260" y2="450" class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="330" y1="-100" x2="330" y2="450" class="mroad mroad-major" />
              <line x1="400" y1="-100" x2="400" y2="450" class="mroad mroad-thin" />

              <!-- Strade orizzontali -->
              <line x1="-100" y1="-60" x2="450" y2="-60" class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="10"  x2="450" y2="10"  class="mroad" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="80"  x2="450" y2="80"  class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="150" x2="450" y2="150" class="mroad mroad-major" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="220" x2="450" y2="220" class="mroad mroad-thin" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="290" x2="450" y2="290" class="mroad" />
              <line x1="-100" y1="360" x2="450" y2="360" class="mroad mroad-thin" />

              <!-- Isolati / edifici -->
              <rect x="-70" y="-40" width="42" height="30" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="-70" y="20"  width="38" height="26" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="0"   y="-45" width="30" height="60" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="65"  y="-40" width="34" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="65"  y="20"  width="34" height="20" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="130" y="-45" width="40" height="70" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="200" y="-40" width="36" height="26" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="200" y="24"  width="24" height="18" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="270" y="-45" width="30" height="30" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="340" y="-45" width="40" height="80" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />

              <rect x="-70" y="90"  width="46" height="34" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="-15" y="90"  width="24" height="20" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="60"  y="90"  width="34" height="50" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="130" y="95"  width="36" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="130" y="130" width="20" height="14" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="200" y="90"  width="34" height="50" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="270" y="95"  width="28" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="340" y="90"  width="36" height="50" rx="2" class="mbldg" />

              <rect x="-70" y="160" width="40" height="26" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="-15" y="165" width="26" height="45" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="60"  y="160" width="34" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="60"  y="195" width="20" height="16" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="130" y="160" width="40" height="50" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="200" y="165" width="34" height="26" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="270" y="230" width="26" height="18" rx="2" class="mbldg-accent" />
              <rect x="340" y="160" width="36" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />

              <rect x="-70" y="230" width="42" height="50" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-lg" />
              <rect x="-15" y="230" width="24" height="20" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="60"  y="230" width="34" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="130" y="230" width="36" height="26" rx="2" class="mbldg" />
              <rect x="200" y="235" width="20" height="16" rx="2" class="mbldg mbldg-sm" />
              <rect x="340" y="230" width="38" height="24" rx="2" class="mbldg" />

              <circle cx="330" cy="150" r="16" class="mpark" />
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <!-- Pin principale -->
        <div class="map-pin main-pin">
          <div class="pin-card">
            <div class="pin-card-header">
              <span class="pin-card-name">La Tua Attività</span>
              <span class="pin-card-rating">★ 4.9</span>
            </div>
            <span class="pin-card-cat">Primo su Google Maps</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pin-card-arrow"></div>
          <div class="pin-icon">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Pin secondari (concorrenti) -->
        <div class="map-pin secondary-pin" style="top:55%;left:20%">
          <div class="pin-icon-sm red"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="map-pin secondary-pin" style="top:65%;left:70%">
          <div class="pin-icon-sm red"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="map-pin secondary-pin" style="top:70%;left:55%">
          <div class="pin-icon-sm red"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gb-results rank-visual">

        <div class="gbr-label">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#ea4335"><path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z"/><path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" fill="#34a853"/><path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z" fill="#fbbc05"/><path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.47 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z" fill="#ea4335"/></svg>
          Google Maps
        </div>
        
        <div class="gbr-item gbr-item--first">
          <span class="gbr-pos">1°</span>
          <div>
            <div class="gbr-name">La Tua Attività</div>
            <div class="gbr-info">★★★★★ 4.9 · (88 recensioni)</div>
          </div>
          <span class="gbr-badge">Top</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gbr-item">
          <span class="gbr-pos muted">2°</span>
          <div>
            <div class="gbr-name muted">Concorrente A</div>
            <div class="gbr-info">★★★☆☆ 3.4 · (29 recensioni)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gbr-item">
          <span class="gbr-pos muted">3°</span>
          <div>
            <div class="gbr-name muted">Concorrente B</div>
            <div class="gbr-info">★★★★☆ 4.1 · (45 recensioni)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
 </div>



<style>
  .rank-layout {
    max-width: 891px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 32px);
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .gb-section {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(59,130,246,0.03) 50%, transparent 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .gb-section { padding: 80px 0; }
  }


  .gb-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .gb-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .gb-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .gb-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
    color: #60a5fa;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .gb-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .gb-card-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── Map visual ── */
  .gb-visual {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gb-map-mock {
    position: relative;
    height: 300px;
    /* FIX: overflow visible così il popup non viene tagliato,
       ma solo se il pin è dentro i limiti verticali */
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .map-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: #1a2332;
  }

  .map-svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

  .mroad { stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); stroke-width: 3; }
  .mroad-thin { stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .mroad-major { stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); stroke-width: 5; }

  .mbldg { fill: rgba(255,255,255,0.045); stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); stroke-width: 1; }
  .mbldg-sm { fill: rgba(255,255,255,0.035); }
  .mbldg-lg { fill: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); stroke: rgba(255,255,255,0.09); }
  .mbldg-accent { fill: rgba(250,204,21,0.12); stroke: rgba(250,204,21,0.18); stroke-width: 1; }
  .mpark { fill: rgba(52,168,83,0.08); stroke: rgba(52,168,83,0.15); stroke-width: 1; }

  .map-pin {
    position: absolute;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .main-pin {
    /* Centro orizzontale, verticalmente a metà-bassa così il popup
       "La Tua Attività" non viene tagliato in alto */
    top: 40%;
    left: 42%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }


  .pin-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    min-width: 140px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  /* Freccetta tra popup e pin */
  .pin-card-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 6px solid transparent;
    border-right: 6px solid transparent;
    border-top: 7px solid white;
    margin-bottom: 1px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15));
  }

  .pin-card-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .pin-card-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
  }

  .pin-card-rating {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #f59e0b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pin-card-cat {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #4285f4;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Pin icona sotto il popup */
  .pin-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #4285f4;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0;
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(66,133,244,0.5);
    animation: pinBounce 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .pin-icon svg { transform: rotate(45deg); }

  @keyframes pinBounce {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-45deg) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: rotate(-45deg) translateY(-4px); }
  }

  .secondary-pin {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .pin-icon-sm {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0;
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }

  .pin-icon-sm.red { background: #ea4335; opacity: 0.6; }

  /* Results panel */
  .gb-results {
    padding: 28px;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .gbr-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .gbr-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .gbr-item--first {
    border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.3);
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.07);
  }

  .gbr-pos {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue);
    min-width: 28px;
  }

  .gbr-pos.muted { color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: 15px; }

  .gbr-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .gbr-name.muted { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400; }

  .gbr-info {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  .gbr-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3);
    color: var(--blue-light);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gb-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gb-cta-note {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
  }

  /* ── Breakpoint 900px ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .gb-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .gb-visual {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .gb-map-mock {
      height: 260px;
    }
    .main-pin {
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
    }
  }

  /* ── Breakpoint 580px ── */
  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .gb-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .gb-card { flex-direction: column; }
    .gb-map-mock { height: 240px; }
    .main-pin {
      top: 25%;
      left: 50%;
    }
    /* Pin card più compatta su schermi piccoli */
    .pin-card {
      min-width: 120px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
    }
    .pin-card-name { font-size: 11px; }
    .pin-card-cat  { font-size: 9px; }
    .pin-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
  }
</style>

    <!-- Sezione 2: Processo -->
    <section class="process-section">
      <h2>COME LAVORO</h2>
        <p> creazione del profilo su google maps </p>
         <p>Per un negozio, uno studio professionale, un artigiano o qualsiasi attività che lavora su un territorio specifico, Google Business Profile è lo strumento di visibilità locale più diretto ed efficace che esiste.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Area geografica servita</strong> 
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>match fra cio che compare qui e nel sito web</strong> 
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>caricare foto e video </strong> caircar efto dell'esterno, interno a 360 gradi come richiede google
        </li>
        <li>      
          <strong>Pubblicare regolarmente</strong> Pubblicare post regolarmente (almeno una volta ogni 1-2 settimane) è un segnale di attività che Google apprezza. I contenuti possono essere: nuovi servizi, apertura di nuove sedi, promozioni stagionali, link a nuovi articoli del blog, comunicazioni importanti. È un canale gratuito e spesso sottoutilizzato.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
 <section class="Prezzo-section">
      <h1>L’integrazione con il sito web e la strategia SEO complessiva </h1>
      <p>Google Business Profile e sito web non vanno pensati come strumenti separati, ma come componenti di un’unica strategia di visibilità online. Il profilo porta visibilità immediata nelle ricerche locali, il sito costruisce autorevolezza e converte il traffico in clienti. </p>
      <p> NAP è l’acronimo di Name, Address, Phone: le tre informazioni fondamentali che devono essere identiche su ogni piattaforma in cui la tua attività è presente. Google Business Profile, sito web, Facebook, LinkedIn, directory di settore, Pagine Gialle: ovunque il tuo nome, indirizzo e telefono compaiano, devono corrispondere esattamente.
Le incongruenze NAP confondono Google e possono penalizzare il posizionamento locale. Prima di ottimizzare il profilo, verifica che le informazioni siano coerenti ovunque </p>
      <p> pagamenti anche a rate* </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Sezione 3: Cosa è incluso -->
    <section class="Prezzo-section">
      <h1>PREZZI</h1>
      <h2>Inserimento a partire da 50 euro</h2>
   </section>

  </main>

  <Contact />
  <Footer />
</Layout>


<style>

/* --- SEZIONE PROCESSO (Resta centrata e scura) --- */

.hero-section,
.Prezzo-section,
.process-section {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 60px 20px;
  color: #ffffff;
}
.hero-section,
.Prezzo-section,
.process-section h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.hero-section,
.Prezzo-section,
.process-section ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
}
.hero-section,
.Prezzo-section,
.process-section li {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
</style>